{{define "content"}}<main id="main-content" class="app-content" tabindex="-1"><div class="container-fluid"><header class="content-header"><div><p class="section-kicker">Layout foundation</p><h1>Component guide</h1><p>All nine AlaTooGuide example groups, adapted to the shared dark Balda theme. Synthetic examples have no application actions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="{{path "/layout"}}">Full layout example</a></header>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-1"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">01 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-1">Colors and typography</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Shared tokens across console and authentication.</p></header><div><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="qa-swatch-grid"><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-canvas"></span><strong>Canvas</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-surface"></span><strong>Surface</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-ink"></span><strong>Ink</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-accent"></span><strong>Accent</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-success"></span><strong>Success</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-warning"></span><strong>Warning</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-danger"></span><strong>Danger</strong></div><div class="qa-swatch"><span class="qa-swatch-info"></span><strong>Info</strong></div></div><hr><h3 class="h3">A clear page hierarchy</h3><p>Body text explains the next action. <a href="{{path "/layout"}}">Links remain visible.</a></p><p class="support-meta">Supporting metadata · 23 Sep 2026, 12:00 UTC</p><code>technical-reference</code></div></div></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-2"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">02 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-2">Actions and inputs</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Primary, secondary, destructive and disabled actions.</p></header><div><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="action-row mb-4"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button">Primary action</button><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">Secondary action</button><button class="btn btn-outline-danger" type="button">Destructive action</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" disabled>Disabled</button></div><div class="form-grid"><div><label class="form-label" for="guide-name">Display name</label><input class="form-control" id="guide-name" value="Example operator"><p class="form-text">Human-readable label.</p></div><div><label class="form-label" for="guide-role">Role</label><select class="form-select" id="guide-role"><option>Operator</option><option>Administrator</option></select></div><div><label class="form-label" for="guide-invalid">Invalid input</label><input class="form-control is-invalid" id="guide-invalid" aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="guide-invalid-feedback" value="Example"><div id="guide-invalid-feedback" class="invalid-feedback">Explain how to fix the value.</div></div></div><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="guide-check"><label class="form-check-label" for="guide-check">Explicit confirmation</label></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-3"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">03 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-3">Status and feedback</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Status names carry meaning independently of color.</p></header><div><div class="action-row mb-3"><span class="status-chip status-chip--success">Active</span><span class="status-chip status-chip--warning">Needs attention</span><span class="status-chip status-chip--danger">Disabled</span><span class="status-chip status-chip--info">Configured</span><span class="status-chip">Unknown</span></div><div class="alert alert-success">Example saved successfully.</div><div class="alert alert-warning">This configuration needs review.</div><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Example request failed. Check the highlighted field.</div><div class="alert alert-info mb-0">Configured does not mean a live connection is healthy.</div></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-4"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">04 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-4">Cards, data and empty states</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Facts, semantic tables and clearly separated destructive actions.</p></header><div><div class="detail-grid mb-3"><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Profile facts</h3></header><div class="card-body"><dl class="fact-list"><dt>Username</dt><dd>example-operator</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>Operator</dd></dl></div></article><article class="card danger-zone"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Credential reset</h3></header><div class="card-body"><p>Explain who will be signed out before confirmation.</p><button class="btn btn-outline-danger" type="button" disabled>Reset example</button></div></article></div><div class="card mb-3"><div class="table-responsive" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Example users table"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">User</th><th scope="col">Role</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Example operator</td><td>Operator</td><td><span class="status-chip status-chip--success">Active</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="page-state"><i class="bi bi-inbox" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><h3 class="h5">No matching records</h3><p class="mb-0">Clear the filters or choose another time range.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-5"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">05 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-5">Integration hierarchy</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Parent integration and nested channel configuration.</p></header><div><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Slack Agent</h3><span class="status-chip status-chip--info">Configured</span></header><div class="card-body"><p class="text-body-secondary">Synthetic configuration, not a live health report.</p><div class="channel-stack"><div class="channel-stack-item"><div><strong>Operations channel</strong><div class="support-meta">Channel · example-operations</div></div><span class="status-chip">Polling</span></div><div class="channel-stack-item"><div><strong>Support channel with a longer display label</strong><div class="support-meta">Channel · example-support</div></div><span class="status-chip status-chip--info">Streaming</span></div></div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-6"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">06 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-6">Messages and attachments</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Conversation presentation examples from the reference gallery.</p></header><div><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Synthetic conversation</h3></header><div class="card-body"><ol class="transcript-list"><li class="transcript-message"><header><strong>Operator</strong><time datetime="2026-09-23T12:00:00Z">12:00 UTC</time></header><p>Review this example attachment.</p><div class="transcript-attachment"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>example-report.txt <span class="support-meta">· 2 KB</span></span></div></li><li class="transcript-message transcript-message--assistant"><header><strong>Assistant</strong><time datetime="2026-09-23T12:01:00Z">12:01 UTC</time></header><p>This is a presentation example with a longer reply that wraps inside the message.</p></li></ol></div></article></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-7"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">07 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-7">One-time values and counts</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Synthetic reveal state and compact quantities.</p></header><div><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Connection example</h3><span class="count-badge">2 bindings</span></header><div class="card-body"><div class="locator-reveal"><strong>Shown once</strong><code>synthetic-example-value-not-a-credential</code><p class="mb-0">An example only. Real secrets must be handled by their owning flow.</p></div><div class="action-row mt-3"><span class="count-badge">12 active sessions</span><span class="count-badge">3 events</span></div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-8"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">08 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-8">Tabs, preview and form footer</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Editorial layouts without introducing a new product workflow.</p></header><div><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Example editor</h3><span class="status-chip status-chip--warning">Draft</span></header><div class="card-body"><nav class="section-tabs mb-3" aria-label="Example sections"><a href="#guide-editor" aria-current="page">Edit</a><a href="#guide-preview">Preview</a></nav><div class="detail-grid"><div id="guide-editor"><label for="guide-description" class="form-label">Description</label><textarea id="guide-description" class="form-control" rows="4">Synthetic example content.</textarea></div><div id="guide-preview" class="page-state"><div><h4 class="h5">Preview</h4><p class="mb-0">Synthetic example content.</p></div></div></div></div><footer class="form-footer"><span class="support-meta">No changes are persisted.</span><div class="action-row"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">Cancel example</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" disabled>Save example</button></div></footer></article></div></section>
<section class="qa-guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-9"><header class="qa-guide-heading"><p class="section-kicker">09 / Foundation</p><h2 id="guide-9">Detail and list layouts</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">Responsive facts beside related records.</p></header><div><div class="detail-grid"><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Record details</h3></header><div class="card-body"><dl class="fact-list"><dt>Display name</dt><dd>Example with a deliberately long human-readable title</dd><dt>Technical ID</dt><dd><code>example-long-record-identifier-0123456789abcdef</code></dd><dt>Created</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-09-23T12:00:00Z">23 Sep 2026, 12:00 UTC</time></dd></dl></div></article><article class="card"><header class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Related records</h3><span class="count-badge">2</span></header><div class="list-group list-group-flush"><div class="list-group-item"><strong>First related item</strong><div class="support-meta">Readable summary with supporting metadata.</div></div><div class="list-group-item"><strong>Second related item</strong><div class="support-meta">Another summary with a longer label that wraps.</div></div></div></article></div></div></section>
</div></main>{{end}}
